Source: RDK AAMP project
Upstream-Status: Pending
Notice: Fix undefined behavior in AdaptationSet::GetRepresentation()

This patch fixes a critical undefined behavior bug in libdash that causes
AddressSanitizer container-overflow crashes.

The issue: AdaptationSet::GetRepresentation() performs an unsafe C-style cast
between unrelated vector types (std::vector<Representation*> to 
std::vector<IRepresentation*>&). While Representation inherits from 
IRepresentation, the vector types themselves are unrelated, making this cast
undefined behavior.

The cast causes vector's internal size/capacity/data pointers to be 
misinterpreted, leading to memory corruption detected by AddressSanitizer as:
  "container-overflow on address 0x6030000bc5a8"

Fix: Change the member variable type from std::vector<Representation*> to
std::vector<IRepresentation*> to match the interface contract, eliminating
the need for any cast.

Impact: Resolves L2 test crash in AAMP after 27+ debugging attempts.

---
 libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.cpp | 2 +-
 libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.h   | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.cpp b/libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.cpp
index a1b2c3d..e4f5g6h 100644
--- a/libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.cpp
+++ b/libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.cpp
@@ -141,7 +141,7 @@ void                                    AdaptationSet::SetSegmentTemplate
 }
 const std::vector<IRepresentation *>&   AdaptationSet::GetRepresentation                ()  const
 {
-    return (std::vector<IRepresentation *> &) this->representation;
+    return this->representation;
 }
 void                                    AdaptationSet::AddRepresentation                (Representation *representation)
 {
diff --git a/libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.h b/libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.h
index 1a2b3c4..d5e6f7g 100644
--- a/libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.h
+++ b/libdash/source/mpd/AdaptationSet.h
@@ -115,7 +115,7 @@ namespace dash
                 SegmentBase                     *segmentBase;
                 SegmentList                     *segmentList;
                 SegmentTemplate                 *segmentTemplate;
-                std::vector<Representation *>   representation;
+                std::vector<IRepresentation *>  representation;
                 std::vector<Resync *>            resyncs;
                 std::vector<ProducerReferenceTime *>   producerReferenceTimes;
                 std::string                     xlinkHref;
